{"seq":27,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"7a5bbad9-7410-44c4-bca5-cbc7e30a177d","runId":"run_1_1788435197646","result":"Done! The function uses `asyncio.Semaphore` to enforce the concurrency limit and handles keyboard interrupts gracefully:\n\n- **Concurrency control**: The semaphore ensures only `max_concurrent` tasks run simultaneously\n- **Cleanup on interrupt**: When KeyboardInterrupt is raised, instead of immediately exiting, the function waits for all running tasks to complete with `return_exceptions=True`, allowing their finally blocks and cleanup code to execute before re-raising the interrupt\n\nYou can import and use it like:\n```python\nfrom run import run_tasks\n\nasync def some_task():\n    try:\n        # task work\n        pass\n    finally:\n        # cleanup code runs even on Ctrl+C\n        pass\n\nawait run_tasks([some_task, another_task, ...], max_concurrent=5)\n```","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":42051,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7a5bbad9-7410-44c4-bca5-cbc7e30a177d","total_cost_usd":0.0318472,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4882,"cache_read_input_tokens":26187,"output_tokens":4402,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":3923},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4882},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":398,"cache_read_input_tokens":13498,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4073,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4073,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1024,"outputTokens":15,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001099,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5"